# CI/CD (ArchiMate AI Studio)

See `docs/architecture/delivery/cicd-conventions.md`.

## Required CI jobs

- `dotnet build` + `dotnet test`
- **archimate-roundtrip** — ArchiSurance 3.2 fixture import/export + XSD validation
- `dotnet list package --vulnerable`

## Branches

- `main` — production
- `develop` — integration
- `feature/<ticket>-<slug>`

## Secrets (never commit)

`RUNPOD_*`, `DATABASE_URL`, `REDIS_URL`, `R2_*`, `CLERK_*`

## Agent

Pipeline changes → `/cicd-release`
